flowchart LR
    mem["Browser memory<br/>12 recent list views"]
    idb[("Browser IndexedDB<br/>display fields<br/>2000 bodies<br/>200 rows per view")]
    redis[("Server Redis<br/>memory-only<br/>display fields until deleted<br/>bodies 7 days")]
    imap[("IMAP server<br/>source of truth")]
    pg[("Server PostgreSQL<br/>header index only")]
    mem -->|miss| idb
    idb -->|miss| redis
    redis -->|"miss: one UID FETCH<br/>per folder"| imap
    pg -.->|"ids, UIDs, flags,<br/>threading"| redis
